---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Case Study: Brand Identity System"
  description="A complete brand identity rework for a Johannesburg brand, including logo design, typography, and scalable design systems."
  image="/logo.png"
>
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="tag">Design</span>
      <span class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Case Study</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Brand Identity System</h1>
    <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-lg mb-8">Complete visual identity rework for a Johannesburg brand.</p>

    <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 mb-12">
      <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/10790.jpeg`}" alt="Brand Identity Demo" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed">
          A growing Johannesburg brand needed a unified visual identity that could scale across
          digital products, print materials, and environmental graphics. Their existing materials
          were inconsistent and lacked a cohesive system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We started with cultural research into South African visual traditions, then built a
          design system around the brand's core values. The system included logo variations,
          color palettes, typography scales, and component libraries.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Logo design with geometric language inspired by interconnected forms</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Color system built around the coral/salmon primary palette</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Scalable design components for digital and print</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Results</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed">
          The brand achieved 95% visual consistency across all touchpoints and reduced design
          production time by 30%. The system has been adopted across all marketing channels.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Start Your Brand System</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>